# Owner review for protected paths (ADR-035, ADR-046). Agents may propose
# changes to every path here; none merges without the owner's approval of the
# latest push (branch protection: "Require review from Code Owners").
# The owner must be a collaborator with write access, or the entry is invalid.

# Specifications, stored data, reference model, snapshots
/tests/specify/                              @ProductOwnerRole
/tests/data/                                 @ProductOwnerRole
/tests/secure/ThoughtTree.Domain.Model/      @ProductOwnerRole
*.verified.*                                 @ProductOwnerRole

# Documentation, including all ADRs and the invariant catalogue
/docs/                                       @ProductOwnerRole

# Owner-only for good: this file, the reviewer agent's workflow and prompt
/.github/CODEOWNERS                          @ProductOwnerRole
/.github/workflows/agent-review*             @ProductOwnerRole
/.github/agent-review/                       @ProductOwnerRole

# Interim, until the independent reviewer agent exists: remove these three
# lines (owner decision 2026-11-16, ADR-035) when it is a required check.
/AGENTS.md                                   @ProductOwnerRole
/CLAUDE.md                                   @ProductOwnerRole
/.github/                                    @ProductOwnerRole
